{"word":"εὐσχήμων","uri":"euschêmôn","senses":[{"word":"εὐσχήμων","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">εὐ·σχήμων,</span></span> <span class=\"des\">ων,\nον</span> :\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> qui a bonne tenue, de\nbonne apparence, convenable, <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\npers.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">M.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">309</span><span class=\"refpb\">c</span>, <span class=\"refpa\">312</span><span class=\"refpb\">f</span>, <span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">d’animaux,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Eq.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1, 17 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">de choses</span> (<span class=\"ital\">discours,\nparole,</span> <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hipp.</span> <span class=\"refch\">490 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Ep.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">329</span><span class=\"refpb\">a</span> ; <span class=\"aut\">Dém.</span> <span class=\"refch\">1391, 16 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Nic.</span> <span class=\"refch\">4, 14,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">prétexte,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plut.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Thes. c. Rom.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5</span>) ;\n<span class=\"ital\">en mauv. part,</span> qui montre un bon vouloir\n<span class=\"ital\">ou</span> un empressement affecté :\n<span class=\"grec\">εἴς τινα,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Med.</span> <span class=\"refch\">584,</span> pour\nqqn ; <span class=\"grec\">πρᾶγμα οὐδαμῶς εὐσχ. λέγειν,</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Eschn.</span> <span class=\"refch\">76, 39,</span>\naffaire qu’il ne serait nullement convenable de rapporter ;\n<span class=\"grec\">τὸ εὐσχ.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span>\n<span class=\"oeuv\">Rsp.</span> <span class=\"refpa\">